yelement=\"217\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Switch account type &gt; Switch to a personal account</strong> and&nbsp;<strong data-identifyelement=\"218\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Switch to creator account options.</strong></li></ul>\n\t"}, {"slug": "48001234317-authorize-net-integration-for-processing-payments", "title": "Authorize.net  integration for processing payments", "folder": "Getting Started w/ Payments", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278591523/original/Sr4Z7WUPAT6VaOaM6ACPHGU_pnXkRXXHhQ58c9.png?1675099996", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278589425/original/uuTirde8-8iEPL9WDkQhaAoDGMfz7n97AA3334.png?1675099374", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278762635/original/GKfxv8yq-4fvH8Z_imbBLYO_QymhEZHU3Q3a17.png?1675167685", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278762749/original/KtjM7pJ7sGxe3bSPyQzvG-RIDVMfNuDZhQ076e.png?1675167724", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278804144/original/HOBNH3in9ASQb-G6x7kYxlwqQhUtTsHISwa878.png?1675175721", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278804449/original/c1PlVkmiNqkN6Ajbwb52IMMBB-Q1Lz-4yQbbda.png?1675175803", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278806039/original/ab0_IqVbPs2X9Vub6cIQlq3doNO09HHYBQ45d2.png?1675176076", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278806389/original/IL6l8BahVDEvcCMpvO9j4AqAB8Uqh_Y17A8c57.png?1675176142", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278806859/original/77rhBaAuwHnXc3dSD99tCHCV_zJ6ygbNZA5e5d.png?1675176231", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278807334/original/ehWEyfGMBx06EEmV6-kny_h2Mbvr-ds-zw0e53.png?1675176320", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278810849/original/6FPZdXeiv4MDSp1d36218_ezuIA6CZaUEA8c42.png?1675177050", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278816562/original/SP8Q-LT4WctAzVMUVMK7OvsFSnxFFOdYXQ3b5d.png?1675178073", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278812831/original/oNCJoq-nbfZtbm7bWPTcq0W76vqY2OQ_dA0f62.png?1675177378", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278814793/original/SzIQaM8S3zpPx-44Zl2HltXRq_KMN3pTow1e46.png?1675177713"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"tdfocus-1675096912084\" data-identifyelement=\"1009\" dir=\"ltr\">Authorize.Net is considered a competitive payment processor due to its reliability, security, and wide range of features. It has operated for over 20 years, providing payment processing services to businesses of all sizes. Authorize.Net provides robust security measures to protect transactions, sensitive customer information, and reliable uptime to ensure smooth transactions. Additionally, Authorize.Net offers features such as recurring billing, mobile compatibility, and integrations with popular e-commerce platforms.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675096912084\" data-identifyelement=\"1010\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1011\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675096912084\" data-identifyelement=\"1012\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1013\"></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--idea tdfocus-1675175441850\" data-identifyelement=\"1014\" dir=\"ltr\">Until this feature goes live, you will need to enable it in the Labs tab to access it:<br data-identifyelement=\"1015\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278591523/original/Sr4Z7WUPAT6VaOaM6ACPHGU_pnXkRXXHhQ58c9.png?1675099996\" style=\"width: 519px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1675099999198\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48278591523\" data-identifyelement=\"1016\"></pre><p class=\"tdfocus-1675096912084\" data-identifyelement=\"1017\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1018\"></p><h4 class=\"fd-toc tdfocus-1677729298573\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Covered in this Article</span></strong></h4><h4 style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Which-Payment-Processor-to-use?\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Which Payment Processor to use?</strong></a></span></h4><h4 style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Requirements-to-use-Authorize.Net\">Requirements to use Authorize.Net</a></strong></span></h4><h4 style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-to-integrate-Authorize.Net-as-a-Payment-Gateway?\">How to integrate Authorize.Net as a Payment Gateway?</a></strong></span></h4><h4 style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Side-Notes-for-using-Authorize.Net\">Side Notes for using Authorize.Net</a></strong></span></h4><h4 style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Test-cards-for-Authorize.net-integration.%C2%A0\"><strong>Test cards for Authorize.net integration. </strong></a></span></h4><h4 style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#FAQ\"><strong>FAQ</strong></a></span></h4><h4 style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Why-don't-I-see-Paypal-among-the-default-gateway-options?\">Why don't I see Paypal among the default gateway options?</a></span></h4><h4 style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#What-will-change-in-the-reporting-of-transactions-done-with-Authorize.net?-Where-will-I-be-able-to-keep-track-of-all-payments?\">What will change in the reporting of transactions done with Authorize.net? Where will I be able to keep track of all payments?</a></span></h4><h4 style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Where-will-I-be-able-to-find-the-subscriptions-created-via-Authorize.net?-I-cannot-relate-to-the-subscription-status-defined-on-the-Subscriptions-page.\">Where will I be able to find the subscriptions created via Authorize.net? I cannot relate to the subscription status defined on the Subscriptions page.</a></span></h4><h4 style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-do-I-Cancel/End-a-subscription-created-via-Authorize.net?-I-am-not-able-to-do-so-in-the-merchant-portal.\">How do I Cancel/End a subscription created via Authorize.net? I am not able to do so in the merchant portal.</a></span></h4><h4 style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Will-I-be-able-to-refund-transactions-as-well-within-the-application-itself?\">Will I be able to refund transactions as well within the application itself?</a></span></h4><h4 style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#I-am-using-FDS-filters-with-Authorize.net-to-hold-transactions-for-review-if-the-address-is-not-submitted,-the-card-code-is-not-submitted,-etc.-Is-the-system-compatible-with-handling-those-cases?\">I am using FDS filters with Authorize.net to hold transactions for review if the address is not submitted, the card code is not submitted, etc. Is the system compatible with handling those cases?</a></span></h4><h4><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#When-will-Authorize.net-be-available-for-SaaS-and-Memberships?\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">When will Authorize.net be available for SaaS and Memberships?</span></a></h4><p class=\"tdfocus-1675096912084\" data-identifyelement=\"1068\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1069\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675096912084\" data-identifyelement=\"1070\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1071\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675096912084\" data-identifyelement=\"1072\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1073\"></p><hr data-identifyelement=\"1074\"><h2 data-identifyelement=\"1075\" id=\"Which-Payment-Processor-to-use?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1076\" dir=\"ltr\">Which Payment Processor to use?</strong></h2><p data-identifyelement=\"1077\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Deciding between Stripe, PayPal, and Authorize.net will depend on what's best for your business. Here's a comparison:</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1078\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1079\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1080\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1081\">Stripe:</strong> A popular choice for online businesses and startups, Stripe offers a developer-friendly platform, custom integrations, and transparent pricing.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675099385983\" data-identifyelement=\"1082\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1083\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675099387743\" data-identifyelement=\"1084\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1085\">PayPal:</strong> PayPal is a well-established payment processor with a global presence and a wide range of features, including a secure payment gateway, invoicing, and recurring payments.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1086\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1087\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675099388709\" data-identifyelement=\"1088\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1089\">Authorize.net:</strong> Authorize.net is a trusted payment processor with a long history of providing reliable and secure payment processing services. It offers comprehensive features, including fraud detection and mobile compatibility.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675099393870\" data-identifyelement=\"1090\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1091\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1092\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Ultimately, the best choice depends on the specific needs of your business, such as the types of payments you need to accept, your target market, and your budget. It's recommended to compare each processor's features, fees, and support options before deciding.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1093\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1094\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675099380685\" data-identifyelement=\"1095\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278589425/original/uuTirde8-8iEPL9WDkQhaAoDGMfz7n97AA3334.png?1675099374\" style=\"width: 584px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1675167282320\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48278589425\" data-identifyelement=\"1096\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675099380685\" data-identifyelement=\"1097\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1098\" dir=\"ltr\">Please Note:</strong></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note\" data-identifyelement=\"1099\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">The data for fees is accurate as of when this article is being published, for more information please check out the Pricing pages of the three options listed:<br data-identifyelement=\"1100\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1101\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1102\" dir=\"ltr\">Stripe:&nbsp;<a class=\"tdfocus-1675099893877\" data-identifyelement=\"1103\" href=\"https://stripe.com/gb/pricing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://stripe.com/gb/pricing</a></strong><br data-identifyelement=\"1104\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1105\" dir=\"ltr\">Paypal:&nbsp;<a class=\"tdfocus-1675099902989\" data-identifyelement=\"1106\" href=\"https://www.paypal.com/us/webapps/mpp/merchant-fees\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.paypal.com/us/webapps/mpp/merchant-fees</a></strong><br data-identifyelement=\"1107\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1108\" dir=\"ltr\">Authorize.net:&nbsp;<a class=\"tdfocus-1675099905839\" data-identifyelement=\"1109\" href=\"https://www.authorize.net/en-us/sign-up/pricing.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.authorize.net/en-us/sign-up/pricing.html</a></strong></pre><p data-identifyelement=\"1110\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1111\"></p><hr data-identifyelement=\"1112\"><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1675099699463\" data-identifyelement=\"1113\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Requirements-to-use-Authorize.Net\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1675167351289\" data-identifyelement=\"1114\" dir=\"ltr\">Requirements to use <a class=\"tdfocus-1675175264528\" href=\"http://authorize.net/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" dir=\"ltr\" data-identifyelement=\"1115\"></a>Authorize.Net</strong></h2><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167892398\" data-identifyelement=\"1116\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1117\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167892398\" data-identifyelement=\"1118\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Authorize.net can accept transactions from <a data-identifyelement=\"1119\" href=\"https://support.authorize.net/knowledgebase/Knowledgearticle/?code=000001207\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">United States, Australian, and Canadian</a> merchants.<br data-identifyelement=\"1120\">Currencies supported with <a class=\"ql-link\" data-identifyelement=\"1121\" href=\"http://authorize.net/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Authorize.net</a> - <a class=\"ql-link\" data-identifyelement=\"1122\" href=\"https://support.authorize.net/knowledgebase/Knowledgearticle/?code=000001207\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Link</a></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167892398\" data-identifyelement=\"1123\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1124\">Before you can integrate <a class=\"tdfocus-1675167931720\" data-identifyelement=\"1125\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"http://authorize.net/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-identifyelement=\"1126\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">Authorize.Net,</span>&nbsp;</a> you must confirm whether you are on a browser that supports using it.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167892398\" data-identifyelement=\"1127\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1128\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167936631\" data-identifyelement=\"1129\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1130\">Below is a list of supported and tested browsers:</strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1131\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1132\"></p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" data-identifyelement=\"1133\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; color: rgb(32, 42, 68); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 300; text-align: start; width: 33%;\"><tbody data-identifyelement=\"1134\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><tr data-identifyelement=\"1135\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-identifyelement=\"1136\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\"><div data-identifyelement=\"1137\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1138\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Browser Name</strong></div></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-identifyelement=\"1139\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\"><div data-identifyelement=\"1140\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1141\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Recommend Version</strong></div></td></tr><tr data-identifyelement=\"1142\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-identifyelement=\"1143\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\"><div data-identifyelement=\"1144\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Chrome</div></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-identifyelement=\"1145\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\"><div data-identifyelement=\"1146\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">v80 or higher</div></td></tr><tr data-identifyelement=\"1147\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-identifyelement=\"1148\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\"><div data-identifyelement=\"1149\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Edge (Chromium)</div></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-identifyelement=\"1150\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\"><div data-identifyelement=\"1151\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">v85 or higher</div></td></tr><tr data-identifyelement=\"1152\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-identifyelement=\"1153\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\"><div data-identifyelement=\"1154\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Firefox</div></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-identifyelement=\"1155\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\"><div data-identifyelement=\"1156\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">v78 or higher</div></td></tr><tr data-identifyelement=\"1157\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-identifyelement=\"1158\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\"><div data-identifyelement=\"1159\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Safari</div></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-identifyelement=\"1160\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px;\"><div data-identifyelement=\"1161\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">v12 or higher</div></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-identifyelement=\"1162\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1163\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1164\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">You can check and verify the browser and version you are using by:</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1165\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1166\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167417394\" data-identifyelement=\"1167\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Use the below help/about information when inside the respective browser:<br data-identifyelement=\"1168\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1169\" dir=\"ltr\"><a class=\"tdfocus-1675167533330\" data-identifyelement=\"1170\" href=\"https://www.google.com/chrome/update/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Chrome</a></strong></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167417394\" data-identifyelement=\"1171\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1172\" dir=\"ltr\"><a class=\"tdfocus-1675167531275\" data-identifyelement=\"1173\" href=\"https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/find-out-which-version-of-microsoft-edge-you-have-c726bee8-c42e-e472-e954-4cf5123497eb\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Edge</a></strong></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167417394\" data-identifyelement=\"1174\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1175\" dir=\"ltr\"><a class=\"tdfocus-1675167528561\" data-identifyelement=\"1176\" href=\"https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/find-what-version-firefox-you-are-using\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Firefox</a></strong></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167417394\" data-identifyelement=\"1177\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1178\" dir=\"ltr\"><a class=\"tdfocus-1675167524955\" data-identifyelement=\"1179\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://support.apple.com/safari\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Safari</a></strong></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167417394\" data-identifyelement=\"1180\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1181\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1182\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Utilize sites like:</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1183\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"1184\" href=\"https://www.whatsmybrowser.org/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.whatsmybrowser.org/</a></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1185\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"1186\" href=\"https://www.whatismybrowser.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.whatismybrowser.com/</a></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167598346\" data-identifyelement=\"1187\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1188\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167604626\" data-identifyelement=\"1189\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">For the Merchant Interface inside Authorize.net, if an unsupported browser or version is detected, two possible messages may display depending on how low the browser version is.,</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1190\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1191\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167621225\" data-identifyelement=\"1192\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1193\">Browser Warning/Out of Date</strong> \u2013 In this case, Authorize.net may have detected a browser/version that you may encounter issues with. You should update to a newer version or use a different supported browser.&nbsp;</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1194\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1195\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1196\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1675175908481\" data-identifyelement=\"1197\" dir=\"ltr\">Examples of Outdated browsers:</strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1198\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1199\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1200\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Internet Explorer (IE) 11</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675175900336\" data-identifyelement=\"1201\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Edge (Legacy)</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167683362\" data-identifyelement=\"1202\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Opera</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167683362\" data-identifyelement=\"1203\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1204\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167683362\" data-identifyelement=\"1205\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278762635/original/GKfxv8yq-4fvH8Z_imbBLYO_QymhEZHU3Q3a17.png?1675167685\" style=\"width: 592px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1675167730137\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48278762635\" data-identifyelement=\"1206\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167683362\" data-identifyelement=\"1207\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1208\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167683362\" data-identifyelement=\"1209\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1210\">Browser Block/Out of Date</strong> \u2013 In this case, we have detected a browser/version that will encounter issues, and an updated browser version needs to be used or a different supported browser.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167683362\" data-identifyelement=\"1211\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1212\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167683362\" data-identifyelement=\"1213\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278762749/original/KtjM7pJ7sGxe3bSPyQzvG-RIDVMfNuDZhQ076e.png?1675167724\" style=\"width: 585px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1675167732745\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48278762749\" data-identifyelement=\"1214\"></p><hr data-identifyelement=\"1215\"><p data-identifyelement=\"1216\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1217\"></p><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1675099699463\" data-identifyelement=\"1218\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"How-to-integrate-Authorize.Net-as-a-Payment-Gateway?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1675167351289\" data-identifyelement=\"1219\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">How to integrate <a href=\"http://authorize.net/\" dir=\"ltr\" data-identifyelement=\"1220\"></a>Authorize.Net as a Payment Gateway?</strong></h2><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167683362\" data-identifyelement=\"1221\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">1. Once you are sure you are using a supported browser and that you are operating from within one of the supported countries, <a data-identifyelement=\"1222\" href=\"https://developer.authorize.net/hello_world/common_setup_questions.html#:~:text=How%20do%20I%20obtain%20the%20transaction%20key%20for%20my%20sandbox%20account%3F\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">you will need to acquire Live and Sandbox API keys from Authorize.net</a></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167683362\" data-identifyelement=\"1223\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1224\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167683362\" data-identifyelement=\"1225\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">For sandbox API keys, log into the <a data-identifyelement=\"1226\" href=\"https://sandbox.authorize.net/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">sandbox Merchant Interface</a>. For Live API keys, log into the <a class=\"tdfocus-1675175700254\" data-identifyelement=\"1227\" href=\"https://account.authorize.net/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Live Merchant Interface</a>.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167683362\" data-identifyelement=\"1228\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1229\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167683362\" data-identifyelement=\"1230\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"1231\" href=\"https://developer.authorize.net/hello_world/testing_guide.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a> for more details on Sandbox vs. Live Mode in <a data-identifyelement=\"1232\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"http://authorize.net/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1675176431264\" data-identifyelement=\"1233\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">Authorize.Net</span></a>.</p><hr style=\"margin-left: 20px;\" data-identifyelement=\"1234\"><div class=\"fr-draggable\" data-identifyelement=\"1235\" style=\"padding-bottom: 41.7188%; height: 0px; margin-left: 20px;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.loom.com/embed/48a47926cee941f2b8b9209fca6bb352\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" style=\"top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-presentation\" data-identifyelement=\"1236\"></iframe></div><hr style=\"margin-left: 20px;\" data-identifyelement=\"1237\"><p class=\"tdfocus-1675175467226\" data-identifyelement=\"1238\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">2. Then you can proceed to <strong data-identifyelement=\"1239\" dir=\"ltr\">Payments&gt; Integrations&gt;</strong>Drop the 3 API Keys you got from your <strong data-identifyelement=\"1240\" dir=\"ltr\">Merchant Interface</strong> in <a class=\"tdfocus-1675176438135\" data-identifyelement=\"1241\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"http://authorize.net/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1675176441495\" data-identifyelement=\"1242\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">Authorize.Net</span></a>.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675175467226\" data-identifyelement=\"1243\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1244\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675175467226\" data-identifyelement=\"1245\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">You can input the <strong data-identifyelement=\"1246\" dir=\"ltr\">Live API Keys</strong> in the Live fields.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675175467226\" data-identifyelement=\"1247\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278804144/original/HOBNH3in9ASQb-G6x7kYxlwqQhUtTsHISwa878.png?1675175721\" style=\"width: 594px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1675178949157\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48278804144\" data-identifyelement=\"1248\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675175467226\" data-identifyelement=\"1249\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1250\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675175467226\" data-identifyelement=\"1251\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">And you can input the <strong data-identifyelement=\"1252\" dir=\"ltr\">Sandbox API Keys</strong> in the Sandbox Fields.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675175467226\" data-identifyelement=\"1253\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278804449/original/c1PlVkmiNqkN6Ajbwb52IMMBB-Q1Lz-4yQbbda.png?1675175803\" style=\"width: 590px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1675178951491\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48278804449\" data-identifyelement=\"1254\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1255\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167598346\" data-identifyelement=\"1256\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Once inputting the desired API Keys, click on the <strong data-identifyelement=\"1257\" dir=\"ltr\">Save&nbsp;</strong>Button.<br data-identifyelement=\"1258\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1259\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278806039/original/ab0_IqVbPs2X9Vub6cIQlq3doNO09HHYBQ45d2.png?1675176076\" style=\"width: 586px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1675178953754\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48278806039\" data-identifyelement=\"1260\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167598346\" data-identifyelement=\"1261\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1262\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167598346\" data-identifyelement=\"1263\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">3. It will show you a quick prompt asking whether you want to make <a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"http://authorize.net/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" data-identifyelement=\"1264\"></a>Authorize.Net<a data-identifyelement=\"1265\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"http://authorize.net/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">&nbsp;</a> your Default Payment Gateway.<br data-identifyelement=\"1266\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1267\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278806389/original/IL6l8BahVDEvcCMpvO9j4AqAB8Uqh_Y17A8c57.png?1675176142\" style=\"width: 560px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1675176156725\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48278806389\" data-identifyelement=\"1268\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167598346\" data-identifyelement=\"1269\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Clicking on <strong data-identifyelement=\"1270\">Cancel&nbsp;</strong>will still integrate <a class=\"tdfocus-1675176456390\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"http://authorize.net/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" data-identifyelement=\"1271\"></a>Authorize.Net but will not make it the Default Gateway.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167598346\" data-identifyelement=\"1273\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1274\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167598346\" data-identifyelement=\"1275\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278806859/original/77rhBaAuwHnXc3dSD99tCHCV_zJ6ygbNZA5e5d.png?1675176231\" style=\"width: 563px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1675176236726\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48278806859\" data-identifyelement=\"1276\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167598346\" data-identifyelement=\"1277\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1278\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167598346\" data-identifyelement=\"1279\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Clicking on <strong data-identifyelement=\"1280\" dir=\"ltr\">Confirm</strong> will integrate <a href=\"http://authorize.net/\" data-identifyelement=\"1281\"></a>Authorize.net<a href=\"http://authorize.net/\" data-identifyelement=\"1282\"></a> and make it the Default Payment Gateway.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167598346\" data-identifyelement=\"1283\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278807334/original/ehWEyfGMBx06EEmV6-kny_h2Mbvr-ds-zw0e53.png?1675176320\" style=\"width: 567px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1675178965114\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48278807334\" data-identifyelement=\"1284\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167598346\" data-identifyelement=\"1285\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1286\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675167598346\" data-identifyelement=\"1287\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1288\" dir=\"ltr\">Please Note</strong></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note tdfocus-1675176611152\" data-identifyelement=\"1289\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">You are not required to disconnect <strong data-identifyelement=\"1290\">Stripe</strong> to connect to <strong class=\"tdfocus-1675179230644\" data-identifyelement=\"1291\">Authorize.net</strong>. You can connect to both gateways on the integrations page. However, since you have connected two different gateways for processing payments, you will need to define a default gateway for processing payments. <strong data-identifyelement=\"1292\">PayPal</strong> will continue to function alongside Authorize.net/Stripe in order forms, whichever is set as the default </pre><p class=\"tdfocus-1675099743716\" data-identifyelement=\"1293\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1294\"></p><hr data-identifyelement=\"1295\"><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1675099699463\" data-identifyelement=\"1296\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Side-Notes-for-using-Authorize.Net\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1675167351289\" data-identifyelement=\"1297\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Side Notes for using Authorize.Net</strong></h2><p class=\"tdfocus-1675176746893\" data-identifyelement=\"1298\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">If Authorize.net is connected and set as the default gateway, other product areas like memberships and SAAS payment links will continue to process payments using Stripe.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675176781422\" data-identifyelement=\"1299\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">If there are recurring subscriptions/pending transactions with Stripe, they will continue to run as is until the Stripe connection is in place. We encourage you not to disconnect any gateway. Defining the default gateway will run new transactions through the desired choice and keep the existing subscriptions running through Stripe and PayPal integrations in place.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675176726560\" data-identifyelement=\"1300\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1301\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675099819406\" data-identifyelement=\"1302\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1303\" dir=\"ltr\">Please Note:</strong></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675099819406\" data-identifyelement=\"1304\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1305\"></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note tdfocus-1675099865924\" data-identifyelement=\"1306\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">You need to upgrade to funnels version 2 to make use of this feature.</pre><p class=\"tdfocus-1675099967078\" data-identifyelement=\"1308\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1309\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675099967078\" data-identifyelement=\"1310\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"1311\" href=\"https://account.authorize.net/help/Miscellaneous/FAQ/Frequently_Asked_Questions.htm\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Click here</a> for the link to <a href=\"http://authorize.net/\" data-identifyelement=\"1312\"></a>Authorize.Net<a href=\"http://authorize.net/\" data-identifyelement=\"1313\"></a>'s FAQ section.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675099967078\" data-identifyelement=\"1314\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1315\"></p><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1675178747198\" data-identifyelement=\"1316\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Test-cards-for-Authorize.net-integration.&nbsp;\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1317\">Test cards for Authorize.net integration.&nbsp;</strong></h3><p class=\"tdfocus-1675178747198\" data-identifyelement=\"1318\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Expiry Date can be any future date, and any 3/4 digits value can be the CVC:&nbsp;</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1319\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1320\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1321\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">4007000000027 (Visa)</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1322\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">4012888818888 (Visa)</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1323\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">4111111111111111 (Visa)</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1324\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">370000000000002 (American Express)</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1325\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">5424000000000015 (Mastercard)</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1326\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">2223000010309703 (Mastercard)</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1327\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">2223000010309711 (Mastercard)</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1328\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">6011000000000012 (Discover)</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1329\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">3088000000000017 (JCB)</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675178766446\" data-identifyelement=\"1330\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">38000000000006 (Diners Club/ Carte Blanche)</p><hr data-identifyelement=\"1331\"><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1675099699463\" data-identifyelement=\"1332\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"FAQ\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1675167351289\" data-identifyelement=\"1333\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">FAQ</strong></h2><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1675176929536\" data-identifyelement=\"1334\" id=\"Why-don't-I-see-Paypal-among-the-default-gateway-options?\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1675167351289\" data-identifyelement=\"1335\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Why don't I see Paypal among the default gateway options?</strong></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"1336\">You can connect to Paypal and use it as a payment method alongside a credit card payment method using Stripe/Authorize.net. This means the default has to be chosen among Stripe/Authorize.net when connected. PayPal can be used independently and alongside credit card payment methods on order forms. and&nbsp;</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675176947380\" data-identifyelement=\"1337\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1338\"></p><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1675176947380\" data-identifyelement=\"1339\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"What-will-change-in-the-reporting-of-transactions-done-with-Authorize.net?-Where-will-I-be-able-to-keep-track-of-all-payments?\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1675176970463\" data-identifyelement=\"1340\">What will change in the reporting of transactions done with Authorize.net? Where will I be able to keep track of all payments?</strong></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"1341\">There will be no change in the Orders/Subscriptions/Transactions reporting. All the payments done via Authorize.net will be available under Payments \u279d Transactions.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675177030399\" data-identifyelement=\"1342\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1343\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675177030399\" data-identifyelement=\"1344\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278810849/original/6FPZdXeiv4MDSp1d36218_ezuIA6CZaUEA8c42.png?1675177050\" style=\"width: 563px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1675177049253\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48278810849\" data-identifyelement=\"1345\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675177030399\" data-identifyelement=\"1346\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1347\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675176987519\" data-identifyelement=\"1348\" dir=\"ltr\">Also, there will be no change in the functioning of workflow triggers/attribution associated. All the functionalities will work the same with Authorize.net.</p><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1675176947380\" data-identifyelement=\"1349\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1350\"></h3><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1675178016885\" data-identifyelement=\"1351\" id=\"Where-will-I-be-able-to-find-the-subscriptions-created-via-Authorize.net?-I-cannot-relate-to-the-subscription-status-defined-on-the-Subscriptions-page.\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1352\" dir=\"ltr\">Where will I be able to find the subscriptions created via Authorize.net? I cannot relate to the subscription status defined on the Subscriptions page.</strong></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"1353\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1354\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675178034852\" data-identifyelement=\"1355\">All subscriptions created on the order forms can be tracked under <strong data-identifyelement=\"1356\">Payments \u279d Subscriptions</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675178034852\" data-identifyelement=\"1357\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278816562/original/SP8Q-LT4WctAzVMUVMK7OvsFSnxFFOdYXQ3b5d.png?1675178073\" style=\"width: 560px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1675178977571\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48278816562\" data-identifyelement=\"1358\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675178034852\" data-identifyelement=\"1359\" dir=\"ltr\">The following list represents subscription statuses and their inferences:&nbsp;</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1360\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1361\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675178036076\" data-identifyelement=\"1362\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1363\">Pending&nbsp;</strong>- When held for merchant review due to FDS</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675178084004\" data-identifyelement=\"1364\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1365\">Trial&nbsp;</strong>- Subscription is in trial mode</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675178084899\" data-identifyelement=\"1366\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1367\">Active&nbsp;</strong>- Last payment was made, and there is an upcoming payment as well</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675178085699\" data-identifyelement=\"1368\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1369\">Expired&nbsp;</strong>- All the subscription payments have been completed, and the subscription no longer exists</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675178086469\" data-identifyelement=\"1370\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1371\">Canceled&nbsp;</strong>- The merchant canceled the subscription using the Cancel action, and no further payments are to be processed.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675178087295\" data-identifyelement=\"1372\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1373\">Unpaid&nbsp;</strong>- The last payment for the subscription was not paid successfully. The subscription is ongoing, but the final payment was unsuccessful.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1374\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1375\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675178107369\" data-identifyelement=\"1376\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1377\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675178108718\" data-identifyelement=\"1378\" dir=\"ltr\">Cancellation will be possible for the subscriptions according to the status:&nbsp;</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675178215384\" data-identifyelement=\"1379\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(42, 46, 52); padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: var(--editor-line-height); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif; cursor: text; counter-reset: list-0 0; transition: font-size 0.2s ease-out 0s, line-height 0.2s ease-out 0s, opacity 0.1s ease 0s, max-width 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.785, 0.135, 0.15, 0.86) 0s; width: 720px; max-width: var(--editor-max-width); text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1380\"></p><table data-identifyelement=\"1381\" style=\"width: 62%;\"><tbody class=\"tdfocus-1675178609235\" data-identifyelement=\"1382\"><tr data-identifyelement=\"1383\"><td class=\"tdfocus-1675178489500\" data-identifyelement=\"1384\" style=\"width: 51.2135%; text-align: center;\"><p class=\"qlbt-cell-line tdfocus-1675178176607\" data-cell=\"cell-n5zbaa\" data-colspan=\"1\" data-identifyelement=\"1385\" data-row=\"row-7fnpsa\" data-rowspan=\"1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(42, 46, 52); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; caret-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); counter-reset: list-0 0;\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1675178181379\" data-block-id=\"block-b87f6eea-ed45-4d81-8a17-0d80647a3574\" data-identifyelement=\"1386\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(42, 46, 52); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; caret-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1675178487025\" data-identifyelement=\"1387\" dir=\"ltr\">Status</strong></span></p></td><td class=\"tdfocus-1675178496705\" data-identifyelement=\"1388\" style=\"width: 48.7865%; text-align: center;\"><p class=\"qlbt-cell-line tdfocus-1675178213592\" data-cell=\"cell-5p4sai\" data-colspan=\"1\" data-identifyelement=\"1389\" data-row=\"row-8olw0n\" data-rowspan=\"1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(42, 46, 52); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; caret-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); counter-reset: list-0 0;\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1675178211279\" data-block-id=\"block-a4759249-2970-4b68-96f1-30f6ffc4ce1e\" data-identifyelement=\"1390\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(42, 46, 52); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; caret-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1675178494785\" data-identifyelement=\"1391\">Cancel</strong></span></p></td></tr><tr data-identifyelement=\"1392\"><td class=\"tdfocus-1675178505199\" data-identifyelement=\"1393\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"width: 51.2135%; text-align: center;\">Pending</td><td class=\"tdfocus-1675178541171\" data-identifyelement=\"1394\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"width: 48.7865%; text-align: center;\">No</td></tr><tr data-identifyelement=\"1395\"><td data-identifyelement=\"1396\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"width: 51.2135%; text-align: center;\">Trial</td><td data-identifyelement=\"1397\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"width: 48.7865%; text-align: center;\">Yes</td></tr><tr data-identifyelement=\"1398\"><td data-identifyelement=\"1399\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"width: 51.2135%; text-align: center;\">Active</td><td data-identifyelement=\"1400\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"width: 48.7865%; text-align: center;\">Yes</td></tr><tr data-identifyelement=\"1401\"><td data-identifyelement=\"1402\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"width: 51.2135%; text-align: center;\">Expired</td><td data-identifyelement=\"1403\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"width: 48.7865%; text-align: center;\">No</td></tr><tr data-identifyelement=\"1404\"><td class=\" tdfocus-1675178615482\" data-identifyelement=\"1405\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"width: 51.2135%; text-align: center;\">Canceled</td><td data-identifyelement=\"1406\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"width: 48.7865%; text-align: center;\">No</td></tr><tr data-identifyelement=\"1407\"><td data-identifyelement=\"1408\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"width: 51.2135%; text-align: center;\">Unpaid</td><td data-identifyelement=\"1409\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"width: 48.7865%; text-align: center;\">Yes</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"tdfocus-1675178215384\" data-identifyelement=\"1410\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(42, 46, 52); padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: var(--editor-line-height); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif; cursor: text; counter-reset: list-0 0; transition: font-size 0.2s ease-out 0s, line-height 0.2s ease-out 0s, opacity 0.1s ease 0s, max-width 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.785, 0.135, 0.15, 0.86) 0s; width: 720px; max-width: var(--editor-max-width); text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1411\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675178215384\" data-identifyelement=\"1412\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(42, 46, 52); padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: var(--editor-line-height); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif; cursor: text; counter-reset: list-0 0; transition: font-size 0.2s ease-out 0s, line-height 0.2s ease-out 0s, opacity 0.1s ease 0s, max-width 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.785, 0.135, 0.15, 0.86) 0s; width: 720px; max-width: var(--editor-max-width); text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(42, 46, 52);\" data-identifyelement=\"1413\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675178123005\" data-identifyelement=\"1414\">Cancel Action is provided only against those subscriptions which are created on Authorize.net. Cancellation of subscriptions for Stripe and PayPal will be added soon.&nbsp;</p><p data-identifyelement=\"1415\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(42, 46, 52); padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: var(--editor-line-height); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif; cursor: text; counter-reset: list-0 0; transition: font-size 0.2s ease-out 0s, line-height 0.2s ease-out 0s, opacity 0.1s ease 0s, max-width 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.785, 0.135, 0.15, 0.86) 0s; width: 720px; max-width: var(--editor-max-width); text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(42, 46, 52);\" data-identifyelement=\"1416\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1417\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1418\">The following flow describes the handling of subscription statuses and payment retry logics in case of a subsequent payment failure :</strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1419\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(42, 46, 52); padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 16px; line-height: var(--editor-line-height); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif; cursor: text; counter-reset: list-0 0; transition: font-size 0.2s ease-out 0s, line-height 0.2s ease-out 0s, opacity 0.1s ease 0s, max-width 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.785, 0.135, 0.15, 0.86) 0s; width: 720px; max-width: var(--editor-max-width); text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(42, 46, 52);\" data-identifyelement=\"1420\"></p><ul class=\"ql-rendered-list-container tdfocus-1675178137240\" data-identifyelement=\"1421\" data-is-root=\"true\"><li class=\"ql-rendered-bullet-list\" data-block-id=\"block-cfa08918-3b92-436c-8323-792147d4a798\" data-identifyelement=\"1422\" dir=\"ltr\">If the first subscription payment is successful while purchasing the subscription on the order form, the subscription will move into the active state<ul class=\"ql-rendered-list-container\" data-identifyelement=\"1423\"><li data-identifyelement=\"1424\">It can also move into the trial status if there is a trial period attached to the recurring product</li></ul></li><li class=\"ql-rendered-bullet-list\" data-block-id=\"block-a3772fcb-49c9-4413-8333-358bab1e45f7\" data-identifyelement=\"1425\">The subscription will remain active until every recurring payment is made successfully for the subscription and will move to \"Expired\" after the completion of payments.</li><li class=\"ql-rendered-bullet-list tdfocus-1675178242287\" data-block-id=\"block-26f8b30f-3b90-4aa4-8d98-35ca5afac62d\" data-identifyelement=\"1426\">If the credit card expires for the end customer in the middle of the subscription, the payment requires authentication from the end customer, or the last payment didn't go through successfully; the status will move over to \"Unpaid.\"<ul data-identifyelement=\"1427\"><li data-identifyelement=\"1428\">The payment will be attempted two more times after 24 hrs each. The status will remain \"Unpaid.\"</li><li data-identifyelement=\"1429\">The subscription will remain in the Unpaid state and will attempt the following subsequent transactions, each with two retries.&nbsp;</li><li data-identifyelement=\"1430\">The next subsequent payment will also be attempted, and if any payment becomes successful, the subscription will move into \"Active.\" Else will stay with \"Unpaid\" status.</li><li data-identifyelement=\"1431\">The subscription status will move to \"Expired\" after all the retries have been made for the last transaction.</li></ul></li><li class=\"ql-rendered-bullet-list tdfocus-1675178245189\" data-block-id=\"block-7377fc03-05d0-46e4-97b8-5c1003d556f6\" data-identifyelement=\"1432\" dir=\"ltr\">If the merchant disconnected the gateway account and there is an ongoing subscription, the transaction cannot be processed; &nbsp;hence the subscription will move to unpaid. The retry attempts will continue according to the retry logic.</li></ul><p data-identifyelement=\"1433\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1434\"></p><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1675177164167\" data-identifyelement=\"1435\" id=\"How-do-I-Cancel/End-a-subscription-created-via-Authorize.net?-I-am-not-able-to-do-so-in-the-merchant-portal.\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1436\" dir=\"ltr\">How do I Cancel/End a subscription created via Authorize.net? I am not able to do so in the merchant portal.</strong></h3><p class=\"tdfocus-1675177173503\" data-identifyelement=\"1437\" dir=\"ltr\">Subscriptions created using Authorize.net can be canceled within the <strong data-identifyelement=\"1438\">Subscriptions</strong> page using the<br data-identifyelement=\"1439\">'<strong data-identifyelement=\"1440\">Cancel Subscription</strong>' Action.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675177173503\" data-identifyelement=\"1441\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278812831/original/oNCJoq-nbfZtbm7bWPTcq0W76vqY2OQ_dA0f62.png?1675177378\" style=\"width: 585px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1675177715340\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48278812831\" data-identifyelement=\"1442\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675177173503\" data-identifyelement=\"1443\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48278814793/original/SzIQaM8S3zpPx-44Zl2HltXRq_KMN3pTow1e46.png?1675177713\" style=\"width: 582px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib tdfocus-1675178985090\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"48278814793\" data-identifyelement=\"1444\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"1445\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1446\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675177646910\" data-identifyelement=\"1447\" dir=\"ltr\">We do not create subscriptions using the Automatic Recurring Billing of Authorize.net; hence, only transaction charges corresponding to a subscription will be visible in the merchant portal.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675177646910\" data-identifyelement=\"1448\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1449\"></p><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1675177646910\" data-identifyelement=\"1450\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Will-I-be-able-to-refund-transactions-as-well-within-the-application-itself?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1451\" dir=\"ltr\">Will I be able to refund transactions as well within the application itself?</strong></h3><p class=\"tdfocus-1675177646910\" data-identifyelement=\"1452\" dir=\"ltr\">No, we do not have the refund functionality within the application. It would be best if you used the merchant portal for refunding transactions.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675177646910\" data-identifyelement=\"1453\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1454\"></p><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1675177646910\" data-identifyelement=\"1455\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"I-am-using-FDS-filters-with-Authorize.net-to-hold-transactions-for-review-if-the-address-is-not-submitted,-the-card-code-is-not-submitted,-etc.-Is-the-system-compatible-with-handling-those-cases?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1456\" dir=\"ltr\">I am using FDS filters with Authorize.net to hold transactions for review if the address is not submitted, the card code is not submitted, etc. Is the system compatible with handling those cases?</strong></h3><p class=\"tdfocus-1675177646910\" data-identifyelement=\"1457\" dir=\"ltr\">Yes, If you hold transactions submitted on order forms for review based on FDS filters. In that case, your transaction will be held for review (or declined as per the setting that you have configured) and will be visible in your merchant portal. Additionally, the corresponding status will be updated on the Transactions page. When you approve or decline the transaction.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675177646910\" data-identifyelement=\"1458\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1459\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675177646910\" data-identifyelement=\"1460\" dir=\"ltr\">Regarding recurring invoice payments/calendar appointment booking payments, we treat the transaction as declined and do not book the calendar appointment or schedule the auto payment since it introduces complications regarding when the business owner will approve the payment.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1675177646910\" data-identifyelement=\"1461\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1462\"></p><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1675177646910\" data-identifyelement=\"1463\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"When-will-Authorize.net-be-available-for-SaaS-and-Memberships?\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1464\" dir=\"ltr\">When will Authorize.net be available for SaaS and Memberships?</strong></h3><p class=\"tdfocus-1675177646910\" data-identifyelement=\"1465\" dir=\"ltr\">As the next step, we are working towards enabling <a data-identifyelement=\"1466\" href=\"http://authorize.net/\">Authorize.net</a> integration in the Memberships area this quarter. Please vote on the ideas board for enabling 