ont-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Save changes.</span></p></li></ol><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-left: 30pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Avoid page builders or plugins that replace forms with&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(24, 128, 56); font-weight: 400;\">&lt;div&gt;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;widgets.</span></p><h4 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Important-for-WordPress-users\" style=\"line-height: 2.12019; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Important for WordPress users</span></h4><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.62; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 3pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Many WordPress page builders and plugins use non-form elements (such as &lt;div&gt; containers or JavaScript-based widgets) instead of real &lt;form&gt; tags.<br>Those forms are not compatible with the tracking script for submission tracking.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.62; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">If your forms do not use real &lt;form&gt; tags:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.62; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Page view tracking will still work, but</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.62; margin-bottom: 3pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Form submissions will not sync to your CRM.</span></p></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.62; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 3pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">To ensure compatibility:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.62; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Use plugins that output valid HTML forms (for example, WPForms, Gravity Forms, or Contact Form 7).</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.62; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Confirm that the form includes &lt;form&gt; and &lt;input type=\"email\"&gt; elements.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.62; margin-bottom: 3pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Avoid forms inside iframes or popups.</span></p></li></ul><hr><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Wix\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Wix</span></h3><ol style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Go to&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Settings \u2192 Advanced \u2192 Custom Code \u2192 + Add Custom Code</span></p>